<props="china">
> The bandwidth values **2G**, **5G**, **8G**, and **10G** are not available by default. To use these values, contact your account manager.

<props="intl">
> The bandwidth values **2G**, **5G**, **8G**, and **10G** are not available by default. To use these values, contact your account manager.

Unit: **M** indicates Mbit/s and **G** indicates Gbit/s.', example='50M'),
  instanceId?: string(name='InstanceId', description='The instance ID of the shared Express Connect circuit.

This parameter is required.', example='pc-bp1mrgfbtmc9brre7****'),
  regionId?: string(name='RegionId', description='The region ID of the shared Express Connect circuit.

